---

<section
	id="contribuir"
	class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-container-low px-gutter py-section-padding-v-mobile md:py-section-padding-v"
>
	<div class="absolute -right-40 top-1/2 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-accent/10 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>

	<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-container-max">
		<div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
			<span class="mb-2 block font-body text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-accent">
				Contribua
			</span>
			<h2 class="font-display text-[34px] leading-10 text-on-surface md:text-[40px] md:leading-[48px]">
				Faça parte desta missão
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 font-body text-base leading-6 text-text-muted">
				Sua contribuição nos ajuda a manter nossa comunidade viva, acolhendo pessoas,
				cuidando de famílias e levando esperança a quem precisa.
			</p>
			<div class="reveal stagger-1 mt-8">
				<a
					href="/contato"
					class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent px-8 py-3.5 font-body text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-white shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-accent-hover hover:shadow-md active:scale-[0.97]"
				>
					Fale Conosco
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined ml-2 text-[18px]">arrow_forward</span>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
